00:00:31.519 --> 00:00:35.500
Trump is facing criminal investigations into
his conduct.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.360
Courts are bracing for violence and chaos.

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:44.090
Donald Trump encouraged supporters to protest
